    "detailed_description": "<strong><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Description:</h2></u></strong><br>&quot;Project: Dream&quot; A Side-Scrolling fighting game set within the future. Fight your way through a small, yet growing, roster of hero's and defeat your opponents! Take on strong fighters or defeat your friends in local multiplayer to prove your skill amongst the competition. <br><br>(This an indie portfolio piece. The game is still being developed overtime and is primarily to showcase my 3D work. New features and updates will come with time!)<br><br><strong><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2></u></strong><br>- Local Multiplayer<br>- Varying difficulty of CPU fighters<br>- A growing cast of fighters<br>- Toon shaded art style<br>- Multiple levels to select from",
